###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - CHGNet, M3GNet and ALIGNN RMSEs are shown only in Fig. 1(a). The Huang et al. errors are per defect site in the SI plots ('eV/site'), while the text gives the RMSE in eV; it is encoded as stated. M3GNet-MP-2021.2.8-PES is linked to the registry model M3GNet-MPF-2021.2.8 through its registry alias.
# - The MACE-MP-0 small release date is not stated, so it is a paper-local run; the CHGNet version is not stated either. Vacancy formation energies, oxidation-state statistics and etched layers are screening results, not error metrics.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: datacite).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/berger2025.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.

